    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40661" root="نهض" body-key="n">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ناهضهُ</span></b> , (S, A, &amp;c.,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنَاهَضَةٌ</span>, (TA,)
<i>He rose with him,</i> or <i>against him, and withstood
him,</i> or <i>opposed him, in contention;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَاوَمَهُ</span>;
(S, Mgh, K;) namely his adversary. (A, Mgh.)

